{"qid": "prov_00212", "category": "provision", "bucket": "b2", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e1", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 12.4, "n_tokens": 80, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.3888888888888889, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 133, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "cited_golden=True key_recall=0.39 (>=0.30)", "answer": "《中华人民共和国民法典》第七百零四条规定了以下要点：\n\n1. 保证人和债权人可以就单个主债务分别订立保证合同，也可以协议在最高债权额限度内就一定期间连续发生的借款合同或者某项商品交易合同订立一个保证合同。\n\n2. 最高额保证的范围包括主债权及其利息、违约金、损害赔偿", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
