{"qid": "prov_00124", "category": "provision", "bucket": "b2", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e1", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 4.96, "n_tokens": 80, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.36363636363636365, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 141, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "cited_golden=True key_recall=0.36 (>=0.30)", "answer": "《中华人民共和国民法典》第六百六十七条规定：“保证的方式包括一般保证和连带责任保证。\n\n当事人在保证合同中对保证方式没有约定或者约定不明确的，按照一般保证承担保证责任。”\n\n此条明确了保证的两种主要类型：一般保证和连带责任保证，并规定了当保证合同中未明确约定保证方式时，应当按照一般", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
